    {"id": "R010", "description": "表格、横向分节、TOC、页码字段、页眉页脚、核心属性和防拆行符合 Word 原生结构。", "weight": 4, "type": "positive", "dimension": "word_structure"},
    {"id": "R011", "description": "标题与表格组织清晰，内容可读可交付。", "weight": 1, "type": "positive", "dimension": "professional_readiness"}
